  "103cc48b-73da-4693-a1d6-6c20316a1059"],
 " result."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"43bd5d16-6294-4cd6-93dc-0acecc4ae9aa"],

Cell["\<\
At radius zero the number is the size of the target support. It is zero for \
an empty target and does not increase with radius. For a nonempty connected \
graph covered in full, it is one from the graph radius onward.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2439969a-9c88-4c07-b1d2-ee36b5a26f79"]
}, Open  ]],

